{#- Avery 18262 (same sheet as 5162 / 5262 / 8162): letter, 2 columns × 7 rows of
    4 × 1⅓ in labels, 0.8333in top margin, 5/32in side margin, 3/16in between
    the columns, no gap between rows. Each label keeps its text 0.1in in
    from its top and bottom and 0.18in from its sides, so a printer that
    feeds a little off still lands it on the label.

    The same sheet as personal/pumpkin-cookies, with the cafe's name on it,
    since these go home with customers. The kitchen note sits on the
    allergen line: anyone with celiac reads both. -#}
<div class="canvas avery-sheet">
    {%- for n in range(14) %}
    <div class="bake-label">
        <h1 class="bake-name">{{ product }}</h1>
        <p class="bake-sub">{{ productSub }} <span class="bake-from">&middot; {{ site.name }}, {{ site.address.locality }}</span></p>
        <p class="bake-ingredients"><b>Ingredients:</b> {{ ingredients }}</p>
        <p class="bake-contains"><b>Contains: {{ contains }}.</b> {{ kitchenNote }}</p>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
</div>
